II. Issue a writ, order or direction in the nature of to Mandamus, commanding the Respondents reinstate the Petitioner in service with all consequential benefits,
including continuity of service, pay and allowances, seniority, and other service benefits as admissible in law;
III. Issue a writ, order or direction in the nature of Certiorari, declaring that the Petitioner's Statutory Petition under Para 364/365 of the Regulations for the Army,
filed against the discharge order, shall be deemed to have been rejected on account of non-disposal, and consequently quashing such deemed rejection as arbitrary, illegal,
and violative of Articles 14 and 21 of the Constitution of India;
It has been submitted by the learned counsel for the petitioner that the petitioner was enrolled in the Army on 05.05.2015.
